# Compiled binaries — build via install.sh: it places outputs in
# ~/.local/bin/mr-review and ~/.local/bin/mr-review-publish.
# Root-anchored: the old unanchored patterns ("mr-review") also matched the
# cmd/mr-review/ and cmd/mr-review-publish/ source directories, silently
# excluding the entire CLI from git (review finding, 2026-10-26).
/mr-review
/mr-review-publish
*.test
